\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.1}{\ignorespaces Comparison of assessment times between manual human inspection and the automated Drishti device across various GPU server configurations.}}{34}{figure.caption.70}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.2}{\ignorespaces Comparative accuracy across three inspection scenarios over ten test cases: manual inspection, open-environment camera, and Drishti. The device achieved the highest accuracy, particularly for orientation-sensitive categories such as \textit {Infested} and \textit {Kernel Burnt}.}}{36}{figure.caption.73}%
